Multi-Monitor Workspaces

This project is a modified hard fork of Omarchy Dual Monitor Workspaces:
https://github.com/derluke/omarchy-dual-monitor-workspaces

The original plugin was created by Lukas Innig and derives portions of the
Omarchy workspace widget, whose copyright is held by 37signals LLC. Their
copyright notices and the complete MIT license are preserved in LICENSE.

The hard-fork identity, architecture, service, settings, IPC, tests, and later
modifications are maintained by bolens. “Multi-Monitor Workspaces” and the
io.github.bolens.multi-monitor-workspaces identifier distinguish this fork
from upstream.
